  "term_and_condition": "<div class=\"lovful-terms\"><h3>Lovful Affiliate Program — Terms &amp; Conditions</h3><p><strong>Welcome to the Lovful Affiliate Program!</strong><br>By joining, you agree to the following terms to help keep our program fair for every creator.</p><h4>1. Commission Eligibility</h4><p>You will earn commission on every qualifying order placed through your unique affiliate link.</p><ul><li>Orders must be purchased directly through your affiliate link</li><li>Orders must not be cancelled, refunded or marked as fraudulent</li><li>Final attribution follows Shopify’s tracking and rules</li></ul><h4>2. No Commission for Google Ads Conversions</h4><p class=\"lovful-important-term\">To ensure fair attribution, any order attributed to your affiliate link but converted through <strong>Google Ads (paid traffic)</strong> is <strong>not eligible for commission payouts</strong>.</p><p>This rule protects the program from paid-traffic manipulation and keeps rewards for genuine content-driven referrals.</p><h4>3. Prohibited Promotion Methods</h4><p>Affiliates agree <strong>not</strong> to use:</p><ul><li>Google Ads or other PPC bidding on Lovful brand or product keywords</li><li>Paid traffic that hijacks Lovful’s search terms</li><li>Coupon-site spamming or scraping unpublished discount codes</li><li>Misleading claims or false advertising</li></ul><p>Violations may result in removal from the program and commission cancellation.</p><h4>4. Commission Review &amp; Adjustments</h4><p>Lovful reserves the right to adjust, hold, or deny commission if:</p><ul><li>An order is refunded, cancelled, or flagged as fraud</li><li>The traffic source violates program rules</li><li>Link attribution is unclear or appears manipulated</li></ul><h4>5. Payout Schedule</h4><p>Commissions are paid according to the standard payout cycle displayed in your affiliate dashboard.</p><h4>6. Program Changes</h4><p>Lovful may update these terms at any time. Affiliates will be notified when significant changes occur.</p><p><strong>Thank you for being part of the Lovful creator community!</strong></p></div>",
